+### World 3D (open-world follow)
+- The Live Map's **3D** button (on a selected player) follows that player
+  through the open world in 3D: the continent's terrain, buildings, and props
+  in a window of N x N map tiles round them (`WOWMIN_WORLD3D_TILES`, an odd
+  number from 1 to 7, default 3; shown in the panel's toolbar)
+- Tiles are built from the WoW 3.3.5a client the first time they are needed
+  (about 5 to 10 seconds each, in a worker process) and cached; the window
+  moves with the player and keeps the tiles just left behind
+- Markers, nameplates, the selected bot's waypoint, and trails from the 1 s
+  telemetry; with `mod-wowmin-telemetry`'s continent stream, player models in
+  their gear and NPCs with their models, health, and combat, within a chosen
+  radius (30, 50, 100, or 250 yards) of the followed player
+- Rotate (Q/E) and zoom like Instance Watch; when the player boards a boat
+  to another continent the view follows, and when they enter an instance the
+  panel says so (watch it in Instance Watch)
+
 ### Dungeon Clear
 - Dedicated **Dungeon Clear** tab embeds the existing DC Test Deck from
   `mod-dungeon-clear`
